{"defaultImplementationsSections":[{"title":"Layout Implementations","anchor":"Layout-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/spacing(subviews:cache:)-8xd0i"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Returns the preferred spacing values of the composite view.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"required":true,"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spacing","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"subviews","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Subviews","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP8Subviewsa"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cache","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Cache","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP5CacheQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ViewSpacing","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI11ViewSpacingV"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"spacing(subviews:cache:)","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP7spacing8subviews5cacheAA11ViewSpacingVAA0D8SubviewsV_5CacheQzztF","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"spacing"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subviews"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Subviews","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Subviews","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP8Subviewsa"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"cache"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Cache","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Cache","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP5CacheQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ViewSpacing","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ViewSpacing","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI11ViewSpacingV"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"subviews","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A collection of proxy instances that represent the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"views that the container arranges. You can use the proxies in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collection to get information about the subviews as you determine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"how much spacing the container prefers around it.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"cache","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Optional storage for calculated data that you can share among","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the methods of your custom layout container. See","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"makeCache(subviews:)-23agy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for details.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ViewSpacing","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instance that describes the preferred"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spacing around the container view."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement this method to provide custom spacing preferences"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for a layout container. The value you return affects"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the spacing around the container, but it doesn’t affect how the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"container arranges subviews relative to one another inside the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"container."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Create a custom ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ViewSpacing","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" instance for your container by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"initializing one with default values, and then merging that with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spacing instances of certain subviews. For example, if you define","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a basic vertical stack that places subviews in a column, you could","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use the spacing preferences of the subview edges that make","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contact with the container’s edges:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":null,"code":["extension BasicVStack {","    func spacing(subviews: Subviews, cache: inout ()) -> ViewSpacing {","        var spacing = ViewSpacing()","","        for index in subviews.indices {","            var edges: Edge.Set = [.leading, .trailing]","            if index == 0 { edges.formUnion(.top) }","            if index == subviews.count - 1 { edges.formUnion(.bottom) }","            spacing.formUnion(subviews[index].spacing, edges: edges)","        }","","        return spacing","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In the above example, the first and last subviews contribute to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spacing above and below the container, respectively, while all subviews","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"affect the spacing on the leading and trailing edges.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you don’t implement this method, the protocol provides a default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"implementation, namely "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Layout\/spacing(subviews:cache:)-1z0gt"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that merges the spacing preferences across all subviews on all edges."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/spacing(subviews:cache:)"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/layout\/spacing(subviews:cache:)"]}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Layout/Subviews":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Subviews","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Subviews","title":"Layout.Subviews","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Subviews","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/layout\/subviews","abstract":[{"text":"A collection of proxies for the subviews of a layout view.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Layout/Cache":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/layout\/cache","required":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Cache","title":"Cache","fragments":[{"text":"associatedtype","kind":"keyw